  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "* Updated dependencies\n- Fix deferred single-yield state machines, shared enumerator reuse, and inverted duplicate/distinct checks (`Duplicates`, `Distinct`, `SplitBy`, `IndicesOf`, `ElementsAt`, `InsertRange`, StringSegment enumerators)\n- Fix deferred `GenerateNumberRange`, `InsertRange`, and null-safe index lookup\n- Fix bugs in: `Exclude`, `Take`/`TakeLast`, `Reverse`, `InsertRange`, `ElementsAt` with `Range`, `CountAtLeast`, `LastNIndicesOf`, `Replace`\n- Fix MsExtensions `StringSegment` bug in: `All`, `First`/`Last`, `IndexOf`/`IndicesOf`, `Split`, `GroupBy`, deferred enumeration",
